; Part of ferrum. MIT licence, see ferrum/LICENSE.
; Inside corner of a pocket or step: o<ferrum_inside_corner> call [sx]
; [sy]. [sx] -1 for a left corner (the wall on the corner's -X side), +1
; for a right one; [sy] -1 front, +1 back. The probe starts above the top
; surface outside the pocket, diagonally beyond the corner, less than
; step-off #3023 from each wall line, within #3020 of the top. z_stack is
; #3021 + tip diameter #5410 + extra depth #3022.
;   1. Top touch on the surrounding surface -> top.
;   2. Guarded diagonal move of #3023 in X and Y into the pocket (-sx, -sy);
;      guarded plunge z_stack; that X/Y is the inner start point.
;   3. Edge touch towards the X wall (sx) -> X edge; guarded move back to
;      the start X. Edge touch towards the Y wall (sy) -> Y edge; guarded
;      move back to the start Y.
;   4. Guarded rise z_stack; guarded move over the corner (X edge, Y edge).
;   5. With #3030 = 0 the active work offset gets X0 Y0 at the corner and
;      Z0 at the top (written once, after the last move).
; Reports z_minus_probed_position #1009 and the two edge widgets
; (#1005..#1008). Moves are guarded G38.3 moves at #3017. Checks
; o<ferrum_probe_ready> first; modal state is restored on return.
o<ferrum_inside_corner> sub
#<sx> = #1
#<sy> = #2
o100 if [[ABS[#<sx>] NE 1] OR [ABS[#<sy>] NE 1]]
    (ABORT, Corner sides must be 1 or -1)
o100 endif
o110 if [#3023 LE 0]
    (ABORT, Probe step-off width must be positive)
o110 endif
o<ferrum_probe_ready> call
M73
M50 P0
G90 G94
#<z_stack> = [#3021 + #5410 + #3022]

o<ferrum_top> call [#3020]
#<top> = #<_ferrum_top>

o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [0 - #<sx> * #3023] [0 - #<sy> * #3023] [0]
o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [0] [0] [0 - #<z_stack>]
#<x1> = #5420
#<y1> = #5421

o<ferrum_edge> call [0] [#<sx>] [#3018]
#<x_edge> = #<_ferrum_edge>
o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [#<x1> - #5420] [0] [0]
o<ferrum_edge> call [1] [#<sy>] [#3018]
#<y_edge> = #<_ferrum_edge>
o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [0] [#<y1> - #5421] [0]

o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [0] [0] [#<z_stack>]
o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [#<x_edge> - #5420] [#<y_edge> - #5421] [0]
o200 if [#3030 EQ 0]
    G10 L20 P0 X[#5420 - #<x_edge>] Y[#5421 - #<y_edge>] Z[#5422 - #<top>]
o200 endif
o<ferrum_inside_corner> endsub
M2
